                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Suspension wear shows up in the tires before it shows up in the ride",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "eyebrow": "PARTS"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-text",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding how semi truck suspension parts work and when they need attention is one of the best ways to keep your trucks operating safely and efficiently.",
                    "width": "prose"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "intro-lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The suspension system carries more of the truck than most people credit it with: stability, steering control, tire wear, cargo protection and driver safety all depend on it. Worn components affect every one of those at once.",
                    "width": "prose"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
